  "journal": {
    "engraved_stone": {
      "title": "The Engraved Stone",
      "text": "The great lift set us down in Irondeep, Stonecrown's hold beneath the mountains. Orin was waiting at the gate with Firstbrook's records. Thane Garrick showed us what his miners found under the oldest foundations: a fragment with the same symbol, and teeth like part of a machine. Set beside the Eldervale stone and Liora's rubbing, the carvings matched, and Garrick remembered a chamber sealed long before his grandfather's time. We followed the old incline into the flooded Old Deeps, mended the drainage channel, and reset the counterweights in the order the carving showed: largest, middle, smallest. Behind the sealed door stood machines Stonecrown never built. Garrick's ancestors swore to guard them. Stonecrown stands with us now, and the machine plate is Stonecrown's piece of the puzzle."
    }
  }
}